== Notes==
*Damage bonus is additive to [[Faction Damage Bonus|Faction Damage Bonuses]].
**As such, it applies a second time to [[Damage over Time]] (DoT) from status effects.
*{{M|Coaction Drift}} increases the strength of your aura on everyone, as well as the effectiveness of everyone's auras on yourself.
**When maxed, this increases the aura's strength to (1 + 15%)<sup>2</sup> = '''1.3225x''' for yourself, and '''1.15x''' for everyone else.
**Consequently, the companion and summon damage bonus of {{M|Summoner's Wrath}} is increased to '''99.1875%''' (1.3225 × 75%, displayed as '''99.19%''' in-game) for yourself, and '''86.25%''' (1.15 × 75%) for squadmates.
**As such, it applies a second time to [[Damage over Time]] (DoT) from status effects.
** On beasts {{M|Immunity Resistance}} stacks multiplicatively with bonuses like Faction Multipliers: Summoner's Wrath and {{A|Roar}}.
** On hounds {{M|Galvanized Elementalist}} or their variant {{M|Melee Elementalist}} stack multiplicatively with bonuses like Faction Multipliers and {{A|Roar}}.
** Summoner's Wrath stacks additively with other faction multiplier bonuses like Roar and Bane melee mods in the case of non-beast companions with melee weapons. 
*The following are affected by Summoner's Wrath:
**{{WF|Atlas}}' {{A|Rumblers}}
**{{WF|Caliban}}'s {{A|Lethal Progeny}}
**{{WF|Chroma}}'s {{A|Effigy}}
**{{WF|Dante}}'s Paragrimms from {{A|Final Verse|Pageflight}}
**{{WF|Equinox}}'s {{M|Duality}}
**{{WF|Inaros}}' Swarm Kavats created by {{M|Desiccation's Curse}} and {{A|Scarab Swarm}}
**{{WF|Khora}}'s {{Companion|Venari}}
**{{WF|Loki}}'s {{A|Decoy}}
**{{WF|Nekros}}' {{A|Shadows of the Dead}}
**{{WF|Nidus}}' Maggots from {{A|Ravenous}}
***Only affects their melee damage, not their burst.
**{{WF|Oraxia}}'s Scuttlers from {{A|Widow's Brood}}
**{{WF|Sirius}} or {{WF|Orion}} when not controlled
***One copy is sufficient as either twin will get the bonus upon swap. The bonus is restricted to weapons and will not apply to abilities such as Sirius's {{A|Jade Stars}}.
**{{WF|Titania}}'s Razorflies from {{A|Razorwing}}
**{{WF|Uriel}}'s [[Uriel/Abilities/Passive|Demons]]
***Only affects the 750 damage over time dealt by Gulphagor's latch however and has no other interactions with Uriel's abilities beyond that, rendering it ineffective for buffing his demons.
**{{WF|Wukong}}'s {{A|Celestial Twin}}
**[[On Call Crew]]
**[[Companion]]'s {{M|Duplex Bond}}
